<%# The empty box an AI suggestion streams into (`Admin::Ui::SuggestionComponent.dom_id`), rendered
    directly under the field's own input -- not in the original's panel with the Translate
    button -- so the suggestion appears inside the field. It carries its own
    `admin--translation--translate` controller instance because Stimulus actions only fire inside a
    controller's element, and Use/Discard live here, outside the button's wrapper. Local:
    `button`, the field's `TranslateButtonComponent`. `data-dismiss-class` is the Dismiss
    button's classes for the error box the script builds itself (the component's, so
    the script holds no copy of a button's look). %>
<% if button&.render? %>
  <%= tag.div id: button.box_id, "aria-live": "polite", data: { translation_box: true, controller: "admin--translation--translate", dismiss_class: Admin::Ui::SuggestionComponent::BUTTON_CLASS } %>
<% end %>
